{"id":912426,"title":"结课测试｜来赴一场满分之约！","content":"<p>你好，我是灵犀。</p><p>《智能原生架构实战》正式结课了，为一直坚持学习的你点赞！为了帮你检验自己的学习成果，我特意准备了一套结课测试题。题目共有 20 道，10道单选题，10道多选题，满分 100 分，快来挑战一下吧！</p><p><a href=\"http://time.geekbang.org/quiz/intro?act_id=9152&exam_id=20448\"><img src=\"./images/912426_1.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p>最后，我还给你准备了一个<a href=\"https://jinshuju.com/f/vkkxkM\">结课问卷</a>，希望你可以抽几分钟填一下，主要是想听听你对这门课的看法和建议。期待你的反馈！</p><p><a href=\"https://jinshuju.com/f/vkkxkM\"><img src=\"./images/912426_2.jpg\" alt=\"图片\"></a></p><!-- [[[read_end]]] -->","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":402612,"user_name":"张彦松","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1019394,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"C5884932E83F23","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/8e/02/abb7bfe3.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1758684197,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":146359,"content":"呵呵，同学加油！","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1108681,"ctime":1758806218,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":402612,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101063601,"comment_content":"答题答的很惨淡啊，感觉至少要学习3遍，才能及格，哈哈","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1108681,"avatar":"https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/udMLnLDPB9MAFMPjybGvs77RnyobHnLocxxVCaIbOG9CbxDSdHjfVJAVmpbE8UfSwTsHCuZgEibLuFIESevZPyQ/132","nickname":"sunny","note":"","ucode":"09130D151D0A20","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":671998,"discussion_content":"呵呵，同学加油！","content_length":24,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1758806218,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]}]}